  "description": "Look up US nonprofits in ProPublica's copy of IRS records: search charities, foundations and other tax-exempt organizations by name, state, category or type, get one by its EIN with every annual return on file (revenue, expenses, assets, officers' pay and the PDF), and run a workflow when an organization's new return appears. No account or API key required.",
